# Frontend Rules

- Use Next.js App Router conventions.
- Prefer Server Components.
- Add "use client" only when browser interactivity or client state requires it.
- Follow `docs/DESIGN.md`.
- Use Tailwind design tokens rather than arbitrary visual values when a token exists.
- Keep components accessible and keyboard usable.
- Use optimized image rendering.
- Keep product grids visually consistent.
- Do not introduce dashboard-style rounded-card patterns into the storefront.
